runs 27 to 74 s on one idle RTX 4060 Ti (measured 2026-09-30: 17.7 s GPU, 10.8 s host, the rest guest), straddling test-run.ps1's fixed 60 s wall budget; run by hand with its .vmargs and a disk from its .disk-mint: tools/codex-vm.exe -kernel <cdx> -output <out> -mem 3072 -headless -disk <minted disk> -gpu-files build-output/diffusion-models -gpu-files build-output/diffusion-text-encoders -gpu-files build-output/diffusion-vae -gpu-out build-output
